1
00:00:04,174 --> 00:00:05,050
<c.simplifiedchinese>难吃</c.simplifiedchinese>

2
00:00:06,095 --> 00:00:08,055
<c.simplifiedchinese>这可不行啊 小姑娘</c.simplifiedchinese>

3
00:00:08,141 --> 00:00:10,560
<c.simplifiedchinese>你得多学学做饭才行</c.simplifiedchinese>

4
00:00:10,646 --> 00:00:12,440
<c.simplifiedchinese>要不然我教教你？</c.simplifiedchinese>

5
00:00:12,525 --> 00:00:16,446
<c.simplifiedchinese>天天吃这种东西怎么受得了 剑心？</c.simplifiedchinese>

6
00:00:16,533 --> 00:00:18,326
<c.simplifiedchinese>没有你说的那么难吃</c.simplifiedchinese>

7
00:00:18,411 --> 00:00:22,749
<c.simplifiedchinese>每次吃薰小姐的菜
都觉得多了一些风味 很不错的</c.simplifiedchinese>

8
00:00:24,381 --> 00:00:26,967
<c.simplifiedchinese>说得像什么佳肴似的</c.simplifiedchinese>

9
00:00:27,054 --> 00:00:29,014
<c.simplifiedchinese>不喜欢吃就别吃啊！</c.simplifiedchinese>

10
00:00:29,099 --> 00:00:31,435
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么嘛 天天来别人家蹭吃蹭喝！</c.simplifiedchinese>

11
00:00:31,520 --> 00:00:34,065
<c.simplifiedchinese>我不做打手之后就没什么收入了</c.simplifiedchinese>

12
00:00:34,151 --> 00:00:36,153
<c.simplifiedchinese>别这么小气嘛</c.simplifiedchinese>

13
00:00:37,909 --> 00:00:40,286
<c.simplifiedchinese>很抱歉打扰你们</c.simplifiedchinese>

14
00:00:40,371 --> 00:00:42,791
<c.simplifiedchinese>我可以和绯村先生聊聊吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

15
00:00:44,087 --> 00:00:45,672
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心 署长来了…</c.simplifiedchinese>

16
00:00:50,433 --> 00:00:52,393
<c.simplifiedchinese>绯村先生 我有一事相求</c.simplifiedchinese>

17
00:00:52,479 --> 00:00:53,480
<c.simplifiedchinese>哦啰？</c.simplifiedchinese>

18
00:01:10,348 --> 00:01:13,810
<c.simplifiedchinese>（原作：和月伸宏
集英社《周刊少年JUMP》）</c.simplifiedchinese>

19
00:02:29,756 --> 00:02:33,135
<c.simplifiedchinese>你说对在下有事相求是指？</c.simplifiedchinese>

20
00:02:33,222 --> 00:02:36,392
<c.simplifiedchinese>这件事关乎警察的声誉</c.simplifiedchinese>

21
00:02:37,022 --> 00:02:40,317
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们已对各报社下达封口令</c.simplifiedchinese>

22
00:02:40,403 --> 00:02:44,157
<c.simplifiedchinese>也烦请各位一定要保密</c.simplifiedchinese>

23
00:02:44,244 --> 00:02:48,373
<c.simplifiedchinese>其实我们希望绯村先生
帮我们除掉一个凶贼</c.simplifiedchinese>

24
00:02:48,962 --> 00:02:50,088
<c.simplifiedchinese>凶贼？</c.simplifiedchinese>

25
00:02:51,425 --> 00:02:53,427
<c.simplifiedchinese>人称“黑笠”</c.simplifiedchinese>

26
00:02:54,097 --> 00:02:58,185
<c.simplifiedchinese>他向许多现在仍居要职的原维新志士</c.simplifiedchinese>

27
00:02:58,272 --> 00:03:01,984
<c.simplifiedchinese>发出斩奸状 然后将他们杀害了</c.simplifiedchinese>

28
00:03:02,530 --> 00:03:07,327
<c.simplifiedchinese>十年来他从未失手
是位技艺高超的剑客</c.simplifiedchinese>

29
00:03:07,415 --> 00:03:10,710
<c.simplifiedchinese>他专门杀害维新志士
就是说要么怀恨在心</c.simplifiedchinese>

30
00:03:10,797 --> 00:03:13,758
<c.simplifiedchinese>要么想变革社会了？</c.simplifiedchinese>

31
00:03:13,844 --> 00:03:15,387
<c.simplifiedchinese>有这个可能</c.simplifiedchinese>

32
00:03:15,974 --> 00:03:20,229
<c.simplifiedchinese>不仅如此 黑笠以杀人为乐</c.simplifiedchinese>

33
00:03:21,110 --> 00:03:23,362
<c.simplifiedchinese>因为目标都是身居要职的维新志士</c.simplifiedchinese>

34
00:03:23,447 --> 00:03:25,741
<c.simplifiedchinese>警方会提供一流的安保措施</c.simplifiedchinese>

35
00:03:25,827 --> 00:03:30,957
<c.simplifiedchinese>当事人也会不惜权力和金钱聘请保镖</c.simplifiedchinese>

36
00:03:31,046 --> 00:03:34,550
<c.simplifiedchinese>但是黑笠却还是能突破重重防御</c.simplifiedchinese>

37
00:03:34,636 --> 00:03:38,473
<c.simplifiedchinese>放肆地大杀特杀 似乎乐在其中</c.simplifiedchinese>

38
00:03:39,271 --> 00:03:43,066
<c.simplifiedchinese>两个月前 他在静冈现身时</c.simplifiedchinese>

39
00:03:43,154 --> 00:03:48,951
<c.simplifiedchinese>34名警察和保镖被杀害
56人受了重伤</c.simplifiedchinese>

40
00:03:49,040 --> 00:03:51,084
<c.simplifiedchinese>等一下</c.simplifiedchinese>

41
00:03:51,170 --> 00:03:54,256
<c.simplifiedchinese>其中有持枪的警察 对吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

42
00:03:54,342 --> 00:03:57,137
<c.simplifiedchinese>-对他没用吗？
-这个嘛…</c.simplifiedchinese>

43
00:03:57,223 --> 00:04:02,979
<c.simplifiedchinese>由于某种原因
他们还没来得及拔枪就被全歼了</c.simplifiedchinese>

44
00:04:03,068 --> 00:04:06,030
<c.simplifiedchinese>一位死里逃生的幸存者说</c.simplifiedchinese>

45
00:04:06,116 --> 00:04:10,078
<c.simplifiedchinese>当时他的手和脚像被绑住了
整个人都动弹不得…</c.simplifiedchinese>

46
00:04:11,251 --> 00:04:14,296
<c.simplifiedchinese>是二阶堂平法“心之一方”</c.simplifiedchinese>

47
00:04:14,382 --> 00:04:16,134
<c.simplifiedchinese>咦？</c.simplifiedchinese>

48
00:04:16,220 --> 00:04:19,890
<c.simplifiedchinese>这个男人 经历了那么多的杀戮</c.simplifiedchinese>

49
00:04:19,977 --> 00:04:24,232
<c.simplifiedchinese>心神大概已经
被血的颜色和味道迷惑了</c.simplifiedchinese>

50
00:04:25,238 --> 00:04:29,951
<c.simplifiedchinese>进入明治已经十多年了
没想到还有这种人</c.simplifiedchinese>

51
00:04:30,831 --> 00:04:32,166
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心…</c.simplifiedchinese>

52
00:04:34,714 --> 00:04:36,633
<c.simplifiedchinese>增派守卫？</c.simplifiedchinese>

53
00:04:36,718 --> 00:04:38,345
<c.simplifiedchinese>不必了</c.simplifiedchinese>

54
00:04:38,430 --> 00:04:40,724
<c.simplifiedchinese>对手只是一个小小罪犯</c.simplifiedchinese>

55
00:04:40,810 --> 00:04:43,854
<c.simplifiedchinese>我连警方的保护都不需要</c.simplifiedchinese>

56
00:04:43,941 --> 00:04:46,610
<c.simplifiedchinese>谷大人 对方可是“黑笠”啊！</c.simplifiedchinese>

57
00:04:46,697 --> 00:04:48,740
<c.simplifiedchinese>注意你的言行！</c.simplifiedchinese>

58
00:04:48,826 --> 00:04:52,538
<c.simplifiedchinese>我是熬过剑林弹雨
迎来明治新时代的人</c.simplifiedchinese>

59
00:04:52,625 --> 00:04:54,711
<c.simplifiedchinese>根本不在意一个小小署长的想法</c.simplifiedchinese>

60
00:04:54,796 --> 00:04:56,923
<c.simplifiedchinese>那您就应该知道</c.simplifiedchinese>

61
00:04:57,009 --> 00:05:00,220
<c.simplifiedchinese>拥有杀意的真正剑客是多么的可怕</c.simplifiedchinese>

62
00:05:01,143 --> 00:05:06,231
<c.simplifiedchinese>所以我才集结了
这么多最强硬汉做我的保镖</c.simplifiedchinese>

63
00:05:06,320 --> 00:05:12,200
<c.simplifiedchinese>他们无不钦佩我
陆军总部最强的谷十三郎！</c.simplifiedchinese>

64
00:05:12,290 --> 00:05:13,666
<c.simplifiedchinese>没错</c.simplifiedchinese>

65
00:05:13,751 --> 00:05:16,045
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们愿意为谷先生效力</c.simplifiedchinese>

66
00:05:16,131 --> 00:05:19,176
<c.simplifiedchinese>你们警察老爷还是回家玩泥巴去吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

67
00:05:19,262 --> 00:05:20,680
<c.simplifiedchinese>说起来</c.simplifiedchinese>

68
00:05:20,765 --> 00:05:24,810
<c.simplifiedchinese>你去外面找些来路不明的人帮忙
真是太丢人了</c.simplifiedchinese>

69
00:05:24,898 --> 00:05:29,653
<c.simplifiedchinese>还说什么这个外人
比你所有的人手加起来还强？</c.simplifiedchinese>

70
00:05:30,451 --> 00:05:33,579
<c.simplifiedchinese>我很惭愧 但的确是这样</c.simplifiedchinese>

71
00:05:33,666 --> 00:05:34,583
<c.simplifiedchinese>咦？</c.simplifiedchinese>

72
00:05:37,590 --> 00:05:42,553
<c.simplifiedchinese>听起来 谷先生
你似乎变成了一个非常自负的人</c.simplifiedchinese>

73
00:05:42,642 --> 00:05:44,811
<c.simplifiedchinese>跟我在幕末时期的剑林弹雨中</c.simplifiedchinese>

74
00:05:44,896 --> 00:05:47,857
<c.simplifiedchinese>保护的那个人 简直判若两人了</c.simplifiedchinese>

75
00:05:50,241 --> 00:05:53,661
<c.simplifiedchinese>你说的“最强的硬汉”在哪儿呢？</c.simplifiedchinese>

76
00:05:53,747 --> 00:05:56,792
<c.simplifiedchinese>这里的每个家伙我都至少揍过一次</c.simplifiedchinese>

77
00:05:57,839 --> 00:06:01,717
<c.simplifiedchinese>跟来路不明的保镖待在一起
肯定令人厌烦</c.simplifiedchinese>

78
00:06:01,805 --> 00:06:04,433
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过就请暂且忍耐一晚吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

79
00:06:04,519 --> 00:06:08,022
<c.simplifiedchinese>那是自然！不胜荣幸！</c.simplifiedchinese>

80
00:06:08,109 --> 00:06:09,569
<c.simplifiedchinese>你们都听到了吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

81
00:06:09,654 --> 00:06:13,825
<c.simplifiedchinese>今晚就让我们冰释前嫌
一起并肩作战吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

82
00:06:13,912 --> 00:06:15,372
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过只有今晚哦</c.simplifiedchinese>

83
00:06:16,376 --> 00:06:20,505
<c.simplifiedchinese>谷大人 外面还安排了一队警察
您看可以吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

84
00:06:20,593 --> 00:06:21,844
<c.simplifiedchinese>少多管闲事！</c.simplifiedchinese>

85
00:06:22,597 --> 00:06:24,390
<c.simplifiedchinese>我是说太感谢了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

86
00:06:31,155 --> 00:06:34,283
<c.simplifiedchinese>距离斩奸状上的预定时间
还有五分钟</c.simplifiedchinese>

87
00:06:35,079 --> 00:06:37,290
<c.simplifiedchinese>但他真的会来吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

88
00:06:38,545 --> 00:06:42,508
<c.simplifiedchinese>他要是不来 那不是更好吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

89
00:06:42,595 --> 00:06:45,723
<c.simplifiedchinese>我猜小姑娘他们已经睡着了</c.simplifiedchinese>

90
00:06:45,809 --> 00:06:46,977
<c.simplifiedchinese>是</c.simplifiedchinese>

91
00:06:47,062 --> 00:06:51,942
<c.simplifiedchinese>他们好像会早点起来
准备好洗澡水等我们回去</c.simplifiedchinese>

92
00:06:52,030 --> 00:06:56,034
<c.simplifiedchinese>但是剑心
你为什么接受这份工作呢？</c.simplifiedchinese>

93
00:06:56,121 --> 00:07:01,544
<c.simplifiedchinese>我以为你不喜欢被叫去做
这种“拔刀斋”会做的事呢</c.simplifiedchinese>

94
00:07:01,633 --> 00:07:03,134
<c.simplifiedchinese>当然 我不喜欢</c.simplifiedchinese>

95
00:07:03,762 --> 00:07:06,598
<c.simplifiedchinese>但我也没法坐视不理</c.simplifiedchinese>

96
00:07:06,685 --> 00:07:09,229
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果黑笠不停止他的暴行</c.simplifiedchinese>

97
00:07:09,315 --> 00:07:11,401
<c.simplifiedchinese>会有更多的人受苦</c.simplifiedchinese>

98
00:07:12,195 --> 00:07:14,364
<c.simplifiedchinese>也包括黑笠他自己…</c.simplifiedchinese>

99
00:07:16,663 --> 00:07:20,667
<c.simplifiedchinese>话说回来 阿左你又为什么帮忙呢？</c.simplifiedchinese>

100
00:07:20,754 --> 00:07:22,506
<c.simplifiedchinese>我当然要来！</c.simplifiedchinese>

101
00:07:22,592 --> 00:07:26,387
<c.simplifiedchinese>这么激动人心的斗殴
我哪能不参加呢！</c.simplifiedchinese>

102
00:07:26,474 --> 00:07:28,643
<c.simplifiedchinese>这可不是斗殴啊…</c.simplifiedchinese>

103
00:07:29,271 --> 00:07:32,900
<c.simplifiedchinese>好 我还有一个问题想问你</c.simplifiedchinese>

104
00:07:32,987 --> 00:07:33,863
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么问题？</c.simplifiedchinese>

105
00:07:34,490 --> 00:07:39,704
<c.simplifiedchinese>你之前提到的二阶堂平法
“心之一方”到底是什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

106
00:07:39,792 --> 00:07:43,838
<c.simplifiedchinese>难道你对黑笠那家伙有什么头绪吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

107
00:07:43,926 --> 00:07:46,803
<c.simplifiedchinese>其实这是两个问题吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

108
00:07:46,890 --> 00:07:49,809
<c.simplifiedchinese>别较真了 快回答我吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

109
00:07:50,940 --> 00:07:53,609
<c.simplifiedchinese>-有一个传言
-传言？</c.simplifiedchinese>

110
00:07:54,196 --> 00:07:56,823
<c.simplifiedchinese>没错 十多年前我听说过一个传言</c.simplifiedchinese>

111
00:07:56,910 --> 00:07:59,454
<c.simplifiedchinese>要说头绪的话我有一点 不过…</c.simplifiedchinese>

112
00:08:01,962 --> 00:08:05,924
<c.simplifiedchinese>-刚才那声惨叫是怎么回事？
-从外面传来的！</c.simplifiedchinese>

113
00:08:07,807 --> 00:08:11,018
<c.simplifiedchinese>他来了！左之助和我走在前面！</c.simplifiedchinese>

114
00:08:11,105 --> 00:08:12,690
<c.simplifiedchinese>其他人紧跟在我们身后！</c.simplifiedchinese>

115
00:08:12,775 --> 00:08:14,026
<c.simplifiedchinese>快！</c.simplifiedchinese>

116
00:08:16,574 --> 00:08:18,034
<c.simplifiedchinese>别晃来晃去了 你这肥猪！</c.simplifiedchinese>

117
00:08:18,119 --> 00:08:21,205
<c.simplifiedchinese>你这个重要人物
当然应该待在中间了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

118
00:08:30,602 --> 00:08:31,770
<c.simplifiedchinese>一点了…</c.simplifiedchinese>

119
00:08:32,648 --> 00:08:33,774
<c.simplifiedchinese>他没来吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

120
00:08:33,859 --> 00:08:36,528
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么啊 吓吓人而已</c.simplifiedchinese>

121
00:08:43,169 --> 00:08:44,712
<c.simplifiedchinese>你们在这啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

122
00:08:44,797 --> 00:08:48,176
<c.simplifiedchinese>不要命的小虫子</c.simplifiedchinese>

123
00:08:54,107 --> 00:08:56,151
<c.simplifiedchinese>睡不着</c.simplifiedchinese>

124
00:08:56,236 --> 00:08:59,740
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是怎么了？有种奇怪的不安感</c.simplifiedchinese>

125
00:09:03,877 --> 00:09:07,255
<c.simplifiedchinese>毕竟是剑心 肯定会没事的</c.simplifiedchinese>

126
00:09:07,342 --> 00:09:09,677
<c.simplifiedchinese>左之助也跟他在一起</c.simplifiedchinese>

127
00:09:10,682 --> 00:09:13,644
<c.simplifiedchinese>你会没事的吧 剑心？</c.simplifiedchinese>

128
00:09:16,569 --> 00:09:19,614
<c.simplifiedchinese>一、二、三…</c.simplifiedchinese>

129
00:09:19,700 --> 00:09:22,954
<c.simplifiedchinese>你们有十四个人还是十五个人？</c.simplifiedchinese>

130
00:09:23,040 --> 00:09:24,834
<c.simplifiedchinese>没我想象的多</c.simplifiedchinese>

131
00:09:25,838 --> 00:09:28,090
<c.simplifiedchinese>这就是黑笠吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

132
00:09:28,175 --> 00:09:30,719
<c.simplifiedchinese>他的眼神真是太可怕了</c.simplifiedchinese>

133
00:09:31,390 --> 00:09:34,393
<c.simplifiedchinese>阿左 在下来当他的对手</c.simplifiedchinese>

134
00:09:34,479 --> 00:09:35,981
<c.simplifiedchinese>谷大人就拜托你了</c.simplifiedchinese>

135
00:09:36,985 --> 00:09:39,237
<c.simplifiedchinese>你们都傻站着干嘛？</c.simplifiedchinese>

136
00:09:39,322 --> 00:09:40,532
<c.simplifiedchinese>快抓住他！</c.simplifiedchinese>

137
00:09:41,118 --> 00:09:43,954
<c.simplifiedchinese>我花了那么多钱雇你们来的！</c.simplifiedchinese>

138
00:09:44,040 --> 00:09:45,083
<c.simplifiedchinese>给我好好干活啊！</c.simplifiedchinese>

139
00:09:45,168 --> 00:09:48,212
<c.simplifiedchinese>谁要是杀了他 我付五倍报酬！</c.simplifiedchinese>

140
00:09:48,299 --> 00:09:50,551
<c.simplifiedchinese>还给他陆军省军官的职位！</c.simplifiedchinese>

141
00:09:50,637 --> 00:09:52,472
<c.simplifiedchinese>-五倍报酬！
-陆军军官！</c.simplifiedchinese>

142
00:09:52,557 --> 00:09:53,641
<c.simplifiedchinese>好！</c.simplifiedchinese>

143
00:09:53,727 --> 00:09:57,230
<c.simplifiedchinese>-这个官我当定了！
-不 非我莫属！</c.simplifiedchinese>

144
00:09:57,818 --> 00:10:00,529
<c.simplifiedchinese>一群白痴！
利欲熏心都不要命了吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

145
00:10:13,683 --> 00:10:16,311
<c.simplifiedchinese>这种感觉 我喜欢</c.simplifiedchinese>

146
00:10:16,396 --> 00:10:17,731
<c.simplifiedchinese>好快的剑！</c.simplifiedchinese>

147
00:10:17,816 --> 00:10:21,654
<c.simplifiedchinese>他不像剑心那样能凌空
但用的剑术很奇怪</c.simplifiedchinese>

148
00:10:21,741 --> 00:10:22,825
<c.simplifiedchinese>退后！</c.simplifiedchinese>

149
00:10:22,910 --> 00:10:25,120
<c.simplifiedchinese>你们根本不是他的对手！</c.simplifiedchinese>

150
00:10:25,206 --> 00:10:26,958
<c.simplifiedchinese>都别想逃！</c.simplifiedchinese>

151
00:10:28,755 --> 00:10:30,674
<c.simplifiedchinese>这…这是怎么回事？</c.simplifiedchinese>

152
00:10:30,759 --> 00:10:32,636
<c.simplifiedchinese>身体不能动了</c.simplifiedchinese>

153
00:10:32,721 --> 00:10:35,182
<c.simplifiedchinese>怎么能让你们跑了呢？</c.simplifiedchinese>

154
00:10:35,268 --> 00:10:39,480
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑一旦出鞘 就得拼得你死我活才行</c.simplifiedchinese>

155
00:10:39,567 --> 00:10:42,112
<c.simplifiedchinese>不然就没意思了</c.simplifiedchinese>

156
00:10:45,204 --> 00:10:46,163
<c.simplifiedchinese>你这家伙…</c.simplifiedchinese>

157
00:10:46,833 --> 00:10:48,501
<c.simplifiedchinese>到底做了什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

158
00:10:49,170 --> 00:10:51,673
<c.simplifiedchinese>我的身体突然变得好沉重</c.simplifiedchinese>

159
00:10:51,759 --> 00:10:53,052
<c.simplifiedchinese>哦？</c.simplifiedchinese>

160
00:10:53,137 --> 00:10:56,640
<c.simplifiedchinese>竟然有人中了我的
“心之一方”后还能动</c.simplifiedchinese>

161
00:10:57,395 --> 00:10:59,188
<c.simplifiedchinese>“心之一方”！</c.simplifiedchinese>

162
00:10:59,274 --> 00:11:02,319
<c.simplifiedchinese>二阶堂平法“心之一方”</c.simplifiedchinese>

163
00:11:02,405 --> 00:11:04,365
<c.simplifiedchinese>又名“蜷缩之术”</c.simplifiedchinese>

164
00:11:05,202 --> 00:11:09,999
<c.simplifiedchinese>真没想到原来你就是黑笠</c.simplifiedchinese>

165
00:11:16,308 --> 00:11:17,392
<c.simplifiedchinese>绯村先生！</c.simplifiedchinese>

166
00:11:18,228 --> 00:11:23,734
<c.simplifiedchinese>幕末时 我在京都
曾经听过关于他的传言</c.simplifiedchinese>

167
00:11:24,324 --> 00:11:29,162
<c.simplifiedchinese>一个不属于任何藩国
有钱就替人杀人的男人</c.simplifiedchinese>

168
00:11:30,294 --> 00:11:33,798
<c.simplifiedchinese>据说是二阶堂平法的大师</c.simplifiedchinese>

169
00:11:34,427 --> 00:11:35,553
<c.simplifiedchinese>孤独的刽子手</c.simplifiedchinese>

170
00:11:36,723 --> 00:11:38,100
<c.simplifiedchinese>鹈堂刃卫</c.simplifiedchinese>

171
00:11:42,276 --> 00:11:45,071
<c.simplifiedchinese>听说过我吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

172
00:11:45,157 --> 00:11:47,576
<c.simplifiedchinese>我也听说过你的故事</c.simplifiedchinese>

173
00:11:47,662 --> 00:11:49,038
<c.simplifiedchinese>使用古剑术飞天御剑流</c.simplifiedchinese>

174
00:11:49,124 --> 00:11:53,169
<c.simplifiedchinese>长州藩的维新志士</c.simplifiedchinese>

175
00:11:53,257 --> 00:11:56,677
<c.simplifiedchinese>刽子手绯村拔刀斋</c.simplifiedchinese>

176
00:11:58,058 --> 00:11:59,476
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心！</c.simplifiedchinese>

177
00:12:01,022 --> 00:12:03,942
<c.simplifiedchinese>“心之一方”并不是什么妖术</c.simplifiedchinese>

178
00:12:04,028 --> 00:12:06,156
<c.simplifiedchinese>而是剑气之间的较量</c.simplifiedchinese>

179
00:12:06,826 --> 00:12:10,121
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果你的剑气和对方一样强
就可以不受影响</c.simplifiedchinese>

180
00:12:10,708 --> 00:12:15,462
<c.simplifiedchinese>去自首吧 刃卫
还是说你想跟在下过几招？</c.simplifiedchinese>

181
00:12:16,052 --> 00:12:17,470
<c.simplifiedchinese>跟你交手？</c.simplifiedchinese>

182
00:12:18,557 --> 00:12:21,560
<c.simplifiedchinese>求之不得 但是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

183
00:12:22,565 --> 00:12:25,943
<c.simplifiedchinese>我要先履行我在斩奸状上的诺言！</c.simplifiedchinese>

184
00:12:26,031 --> 00:12:29,201
<c.simplifiedchinese>糟了！谷大人
快集中精力破解他的秘技！</c.simplifiedchinese>

185
00:12:29,287 --> 00:12:33,249
<c.simplifiedchinese>少废话！
这头烂肥猪绝对不可能破解的了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

186
00:12:34,380 --> 00:12:36,549
<c.simplifiedchinese>-阿左！
-想将我的军</c.simplifiedchinese>

187
00:12:36,635 --> 00:12:38,470
<c.simplifiedchinese>还早着呢！</c.simplifiedchinese>

188
00:12:39,515 --> 00:12:40,725
<c.simplifiedchinese>怎么样？</c.simplifiedchinese>

189
00:12:45,653 --> 00:12:46,695
<c.simplifiedchinese>刃卫！</c.simplifiedchinese>

190
00:12:51,748 --> 00:12:53,124
<c.simplifiedchinese>能动了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

191
00:12:56,800 --> 00:12:58,426
<c.simplifiedchinese>真有意思</c.simplifiedchinese>

192
00:12:58,512 --> 00:13:01,306
<c.simplifiedchinese>比幕末以来的所有事情都有意思</c.simplifiedchinese>

193
00:13:01,393 --> 00:13:03,561
<c.simplifiedchinese>我改变目标了</c.simplifiedchinese>

194
00:13:03,647 --> 00:13:07,025
<c.simplifiedchinese>下一个猎物就是你 刽子手拔刀斋</c.simplifiedchinese>

195
00:13:07,113 --> 00:13:10,825
<c.simplifiedchinese>我很快就会再次出现</c.simplifiedchinese>

196
00:13:10,911 --> 00:13:15,874
<c.simplifiedchinese>在那之前 丢掉你这把逆刃刀
准备一把真正的刀吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

197
00:13:18,844 --> 00:13:21,054
<c.simplifiedchinese>你还好吗 阿左？</c.simplifiedchinese>

198
00:13:21,141 --> 00:13:23,601
<c.simplifiedchinese>嗯 这点伤不算什么</c.simplifiedchinese>

199
00:13:23,687 --> 00:13:24,688
<c.simplifiedchinese>绯村先生！</c.simplifiedchinese>

200
00:13:24,772 --> 00:13:26,774
<c.simplifiedchinese>请尽快为这些人提供急救处理</c.simplifiedchinese>

201
00:13:26,860 --> 00:13:28,862
<c.simplifiedchinese>或许还有救</c.simplifiedchinese>

202
00:13:28,947 --> 00:13:29,990
<c.simplifiedchinese>是</c.simplifiedchinese>

203
00:13:30,075 --> 00:13:34,955
<c.simplifiedchinese>但是绯村先生 现在他盯上你了</c.simplifiedchinese>

204
00:13:35,044 --> 00:13:36,420
<c.simplifiedchinese>没关系</c.simplifiedchinese>

205
00:13:36,504 --> 00:13:38,673
<c.simplifiedchinese>未尝不是一件好事</c.simplifiedchinese>

206
00:13:39,260 --> 00:13:40,303
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心…</c.simplifiedchinese>

207
00:13:40,387 --> 00:13:45,267
<c.simplifiedchinese>难道你一开始就料到
事情会发展成这样吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

208
00:13:46,232 --> 00:13:51,988
<c.simplifiedchinese>我当然希望事情就此结束
但恐怕没这么简单</c.simplifiedchinese>

209
00:13:52,870 --> 00:13:54,747
<c.simplifiedchinese>黑笠刃卫</c.simplifiedchinese>

210
00:13:54,832 --> 00:13:57,502
<c.simplifiedchinese>他没那么容易对付</c.simplifiedchinese>

211
00:14:07,233 --> 00:14:10,486
<c.simplifiedchinese>六人重伤 三人轻伤</c.simplifiedchinese>

212
00:14:10,572 --> 00:14:14,493
<c.simplifiedchinese>黑笠行凶以来
伤亡数这么低还是第一次</c.simplifiedchinese>

213
00:14:14,580 --> 00:14:16,874
<c.simplifiedchinese>说实话 这实在不是值得高兴的事</c.simplifiedchinese>

214
00:14:16,960 --> 00:14:18,795
<c.simplifiedchinese>你别要求太高了</c.simplifiedchinese>

215
00:14:18,880 --> 00:14:21,842
<c.simplifiedchinese>没闹出人命来就已经很好了</c.simplifiedchinese>

216
00:14:22,430 --> 00:14:23,973
<c.simplifiedchinese>顺便问一下</c.simplifiedchinese>

217
00:14:24,058 --> 00:14:27,520
<c.simplifiedchinese>鹈堂刃卫的二阶堂平法到底是什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

218
00:14:27,606 --> 00:14:31,777
<c.simplifiedchinese>二阶堂平法是一种包含
“一”字、“八”字</c.simplifiedchinese>

219
00:14:31,865 --> 00:14:35,243
<c.simplifiedchinese>“十”字三种姿势的剑术</c.simplifiedchinese>

220
00:14:35,330 --> 00:14:40,043
<c.simplifiedchinese>依次按“一”、“八”、“十”挥剑
就构成一个“平”字</c.simplifiedchinese>

221
00:14:40,132 --> 00:14:42,843
<c.simplifiedchinese>因此得名二阶堂平法</c.simplifiedchinese>

222
00:14:42,928 --> 00:14:46,515
<c.simplifiedchinese>这种剑术以奇怪而可怕的奥义而闻名</c.simplifiedchinese>

223
00:14:46,603 --> 00:14:51,065
<c.simplifiedchinese>据说只有剑术的创造者
才会使用奥义“心之一方”</c.simplifiedchinese>

224
00:14:51,821 --> 00:14:58,703
<c.simplifiedchinese>向对手释放压倒性的剑气
让他们动弹不得 是秘技中的秘技</c.simplifiedchinese>

225
00:14:59,504 --> 00:15:01,547
<c.simplifiedchinese>我以为他会在交战中使用这招</c.simplifiedchinese>

226
00:15:01,633 --> 00:15:03,802
<c.simplifiedchinese>没想到他却用在肆意杀害那些</c.simplifiedchinese>

227
00:15:03,887 --> 00:15:07,849
<c.simplifiedchinese>已经失去战意 试图逃跑的人身上</c.simplifiedchinese>

228
00:15:07,937 --> 00:15:10,189
<c.simplifiedchinese>如此残暴…</c.simplifiedchinese>

229
00:15:10,275 --> 00:15:12,236
<c.simplifiedchinese>确实啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

230
00:15:12,321 --> 00:15:15,324
<c.simplifiedchinese>但我们这边有最强的男人</c.simplifiedchinese>

231
00:15:15,410 --> 00:15:18,914
<c.simplifiedchinese>-所以 大可不用担心啦
-那倒未必</c.simplifiedchinese>

232
00:15:21,756 --> 00:15:26,719
<c.simplifiedchinese>在维新后这十年里
在下早已立下誓言不再杀人</c.simplifiedchinese>

233
00:15:27,351 --> 00:15:31,063
<c.simplifiedchinese>他却倒行逆施 从未停止杀戮</c.simplifiedchinese>

234
00:15:32,068 --> 00:15:34,571
<c.simplifiedchinese>同是刽子手 却天差地别</c.simplifiedchinese>

235
00:15:35,576 --> 00:15:39,454
<c.simplifiedchinese>我不知道刃卫
是在何时何地掌握了二阶堂平法</c.simplifiedchinese>

236
00:15:39,542 --> 00:15:42,169
<c.simplifiedchinese>但他幕末第一次在京都露面时</c.simplifiedchinese>

237
00:15:42,256 --> 00:15:44,800
<c.simplifiedchinese>是新选组的成员</c.simplifiedchinese>

238
00:15:44,886 --> 00:15:48,764
<c.simplifiedchinese>新选组？
那不是幕府最强的剑客集团吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

239
00:15:48,852 --> 00:15:50,562
<c.simplifiedchinese>所以他是维新志士的宿敌啊！</c.simplifiedchinese>

240
00:15:51,357 --> 00:15:55,695
<c.simplifiedchinese>刃卫确实杀了许多维新志士</c.simplifiedchinese>

241
00:15:55,782 --> 00:15:58,994
<c.simplifiedchinese>但他也滥杀了很多无辜的人</c.simplifiedchinese>

242
00:15:59,080 --> 00:16:06,046
<c.simplifiedchinese>因此遭到了组织的肃清
和组织反目成仇 最后脱离了新选组</c.simplifiedchinese>

243
00:16:06,136 --> 00:16:12,601
<c.simplifiedchinese>几个月后他重现江湖 这次却是
以刽子手的身份成了维新志士的伙伴</c.simplifiedchinese>

244
00:16:13,443 --> 00:16:18,490
<c.simplifiedchinese>先支持幕府 又加入倒幕派
他根本不认同任何一种政治理想</c.simplifiedchinese>

245
00:16:18,578 --> 00:16:22,874
<c.simplifiedchinese>刃卫有的只是杀戮的欲望罢了</c.simplifiedchinese>

246
00:16:22,962 --> 00:16:26,882
<c.simplifiedchinese>只被杀意驱动
真是个穷凶极恶的刽子手</c.simplifiedchinese>

247
00:16:26,970 --> 00:16:29,847
<c.simplifiedchinese>而且还掌握了传说中的奥义</c.simplifiedchinese>

248
00:16:30,560 --> 00:16:32,854
<c.simplifiedchinese>这不是我能打的架啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

249
00:16:32,940 --> 00:16:35,192
<c.simplifiedchinese>他的目标只有在下一人</c.simplifiedchinese>

250
00:16:35,277 --> 00:16:37,571
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下来当他唯一的对手</c.simplifiedchinese>

251
00:16:37,658 --> 00:16:42,621
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过 有件事在下想拜托你</c.simplifiedchinese>

252
00:16:44,505 --> 00:16:47,925
<c.simplifiedchinese>真是的…好难看的表情</c.simplifiedchinese>

253
00:16:48,012 --> 00:16:51,098
<c.simplifiedchinese>妙龄少女竟然像老奶奶一样
坐着睡着了</c.simplifiedchinese>

254
00:16:51,184 --> 00:16:54,062
<c.simplifiedchinese>看来她昨晚整夜没合眼吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

255
00:16:54,149 --> 00:16:55,191
<c.simplifiedchinese>哦？</c.simplifiedchinese>

256
00:16:55,276 --> 00:16:57,653
<c.simplifiedchinese>小姑娘 醒醒</c.simplifiedchinese>

257
00:16:58,491 --> 00:17:00,618
<c.simplifiedchinese>喂…醒醒</c.simplifiedchinese>

258
00:17:04,044 --> 00:17:07,172
<c.simplifiedchinese>-你回来了
-我回来了</c.simplifiedchinese>

259
00:17:07,258 --> 00:17:10,136
<c.simplifiedchinese>等一下 剑心在哪？</c.simplifiedchinese>

260
00:17:10,222 --> 00:17:12,141
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心不会回来了</c.simplifiedchinese>

261
00:17:14,774 --> 00:17:19,111
<c.simplifiedchinese>所以 这次凶手就追上了他</c.simplifiedchinese>

262
00:17:19,199 --> 00:17:22,660
<c.simplifiedchinese>他不在的时候 就由我来照顾你们</c.simplifiedchinese>

263
00:17:22,748 --> 00:17:24,666
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心去哪了？</c.simplifiedchinese>

264
00:17:24,752 --> 00:17:26,545
<c.simplifiedchinese>他说他要去河边</c.simplifiedchinese>

265
00:17:27,131 --> 00:17:30,968
<c.simplifiedchinese>幕末的刽子手为了进可攻退可守</c.simplifiedchinese>

266
00:17:31,056 --> 00:17:33,767
<c.simplifiedchinese>经常以河边为基地采取行动</c.simplifiedchinese>

267
00:17:33,853 --> 00:17:36,106
<c.simplifiedchinese>我去河边的话 刃卫更容易找到我</c.simplifiedchinese>

268
00:17:36,191 --> 00:17:37,818
<c.simplifiedchinese>他这么说的</c.simplifiedchinese>

269
00:17:38,530 --> 00:17:39,697
<c.simplifiedchinese>喂 你去哪啊？</c.simplifiedchinese>

270
00:17:40,492 --> 00:17:42,786
<c.simplifiedchinese>还用问吗？我去找剑心！</c.simplifiedchinese>

271
00:17:42,871 --> 00:17:44,414
<c.simplifiedchinese>傻瓜！</c.simplifiedchinese>

272
00:17:44,500 --> 00:17:46,585
<c.simplifiedchinese>刃卫不是简单的对手</c.simplifiedchinese>

273
00:17:46,671 --> 00:17:48,005
<c.simplifiedchinese>从我的伤你看不出来吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

274
00:17:48,090 --> 00:17:51,593
<c.simplifiedchinese>你去找他反而会成为他的绊脚石</c.simplifiedchinese>

275
00:17:51,681 --> 00:17:53,766
<c.simplifiedchinese>你在这里静静地等他 对大家都好…</c.simplifiedchinese>

276
00:17:53,852 --> 00:17:55,603
<c.simplifiedchinese>那剑心和刃卫交手后</c.simplifiedchinese>

277
00:17:55,689 --> 00:17:59,317
<c.simplifiedchinese>要是再也不回来
又继续去流浪了怎么办？</c.simplifiedchinese>

278
00:17:59,404 --> 00:18:04,951
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下是浪客
所以可能又要开始浪迹天涯了</c.simplifiedchinese>

279
00:18:06,669 --> 00:18:13,009
<c.simplifiedchinese>我父亲去世了 喜兵卫背叛了我
要是剑心也离开我…</c.simplifiedchinese>

280
00:18:14,894 --> 00:18:18,939
<c.simplifiedchinese>与其再一个人孤零零的
我宁愿去直面危险！</c.simplifiedchinese>

281
00:18:19,027 --> 00:18:21,779
<c.simplifiedchinese>&lrm;（恶）</c.simplifiedchinese>

282
00:18:21,866 --> 00:18:25,411
<c.simplifiedchinese>跟剑心分开她就担心的不得了啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

283
00:18:25,498 --> 00:18:27,626
<c.simplifiedchinese>真是个任性的小姑娘</c.simplifiedchinese>

284
00:18:27,711 --> 00:18:32,132
<c.simplifiedchinese>好吧 有时候
也很难分清任性和爱恋…</c.simplifiedchinese>

285
00:18:32,220 --> 00:18:34,764
<c.simplifiedchinese>而且她说“一个人孤零零的”</c.simplifiedchinese>

286
00:18:34,850 --> 00:18:36,977
<c.simplifiedchinese>你完全被她忽略啦</c.simplifiedchinese>

287
00:18:37,063 --> 00:18:38,481
<c.simplifiedchinese>那有什么办法呢？</c.simplifiedchinese>

288
00:18:38,566 --> 00:18:41,110
<c.simplifiedchinese>他可是剑心 日本最强的男人</c.simplifiedchinese>

289
00:18:41,196 --> 00:18:44,699
<c.simplifiedchinese>顺带一提 第二强的是我 明白？</c.simplifiedchinese>

290
00:18:44,787 --> 00:18:47,915
<c.simplifiedchinese>那我就是日本第三咯？</c.simplifiedchinese>

291
00:18:48,001 --> 00:18:51,797
<c.simplifiedchinese>我要去洗个澡睡一觉
后面就拜托你了</c.simplifiedchinese>

292
00:18:51,884 --> 00:18:53,761
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心可指望着你呢</c.simplifiedchinese>

293
00:18:53,846 --> 00:18:55,807
<c.simplifiedchinese>你倒是再有责任心一点啊！</c.simplifiedchinese>

294
00:19:03,115 --> 00:19:05,659
<c.simplifiedchinese>上游肯定下了大雨</c.simplifiedchinese>

295
00:19:05,745 --> 00:19:07,580
<c.simplifiedchinese>河水涨了</c.simplifiedchinese>

296
00:19:07,666 --> 00:19:09,751
<c.simplifiedchinese>掉进去的话就完了</c.simplifiedchinese>

297
00:19:13,051 --> 00:19:14,011
<c.simplifiedchinese>他来了</c.simplifiedchinese>

298
00:19:16,057 --> 00:19:18,727
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心…</c.simplifiedchinese>

299
00:19:18,813 --> 00:19:21,024
<c.simplifiedchinese>找到你了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

300
00:19:22,320 --> 00:19:24,739
<c.simplifiedchinese>她比刃卫还可怕…</c.simplifiedchinese>

301
00:19:26,244 --> 00:19:27,871
<c.simplifiedchinese>我听左之助说了</c.simplifiedchinese>

302
00:19:27,956 --> 00:19:30,584
<c.simplifiedchinese>你暂时不打算回道场了</c.simplifiedchinese>

303
00:19:32,381 --> 00:19:34,842
<c.simplifiedchinese>那我也不回去了</c.simplifiedchinese>

304
00:19:34,928 --> 00:19:36,013
<c.simplifiedchinese>我要和你在一起</c.simplifiedchinese>

305
00:19:38,770 --> 00:19:42,357
<c.simplifiedchinese>薰小姐 你和左之助吵架了吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

306
00:19:42,443 --> 00:19:44,695
<c.simplifiedchinese>-还是和弥彦吵架了？
-都没有</c.simplifiedchinese>

307
00:19:47,036 --> 00:19:49,288
<c.simplifiedchinese>你听说刃卫的事了 对吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

308
00:19:49,374 --> 00:19:51,667
<c.simplifiedchinese>听说了 那我也不回去</c.simplifiedchinese>

309
00:19:51,754 --> 00:19:54,423
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果我要一边打斗一边保护别人</c.simplifiedchinese>

310
00:19:55,260 --> 00:19:56,887
<c.simplifiedchinese>是很难打败刃卫的</c.simplifiedchinese>

311
00:20:02,776 --> 00:20:03,652
<c.simplifiedchinese>薰小姐</c.simplifiedchinese>

312
00:20:06,282 --> 00:20:08,827
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是我最喜欢的靛蓝色发带</c.simplifiedchinese>

313
00:20:08,913 --> 00:20:09,914
<c.simplifiedchinese>现在借给你</c.simplifiedchinese>

314
00:20:10,792 --> 00:20:12,669
<c.simplifiedchinese>不用了 我借来也…</c.simplifiedchinese>

315
00:20:12,754 --> 00:20:14,798
<c.simplifiedchinese>-叫你借你就借！
-是！</c.simplifiedchinese>

316
00:20:14,883 --> 00:20:17,886
<c.simplifiedchinese>说好了？我只是把它借给你</c.simplifiedchinese>

317
00:20:17,973 --> 00:20:19,015
<c.simplifiedchinese>一定要好好还给我</c.simplifiedchinese>

318
00:20:21,187 --> 00:20:22,939
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果你和刃卫决斗后</c.simplifiedchinese>

319
00:20:23,024 --> 00:20:27,779
<c.simplifiedchinese>不还给我就一个人去流浪了
我是绝对不会原谅你的</c.simplifiedchinese>

320
00:20:30,539 --> 00:20:33,959
<c.simplifiedchinese>我明白了 我一定会把它还给你的</c.simplifiedchinese>

321
00:20:34,046 --> 00:20:36,174
<c.simplifiedchinese>你就在道场安心等我回来吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

322
00:20:39,808 --> 00:20:40,684
<c.simplifiedchinese>那好…</c.simplifiedchinese>

323
00:20:45,945 --> 00:20:47,155
<c.simplifiedchinese>薰小姐！</c.simplifiedchinese>

324
00:20:48,074 --> 00:20:50,285
<c.simplifiedchinese>我都看见了 拔刀斋！</c.simplifiedchinese>

325
00:20:50,370 --> 00:20:52,873
<c.simplifiedchinese>这个小姑娘是你的女人！</c.simplifiedchinese>

326
00:20:52,959 --> 00:20:56,087
<c.simplifiedchinese>-刃卫 你这混蛋！
-生气吧 发怒吧！</c.simplifiedchinese>

327
00:20:56,174 --> 00:21:00,178
<c.simplifiedchinese>这样你就会重新变回十年前的那个人</c.simplifiedchinese>

328
00:21:00,265 --> 00:21:03,352
<c.simplifiedchinese>变成传说中最强的冷酷刽子手！</c.simplifiedchinese>

329
00:21:03,438 --> 00:21:06,650
<c.simplifiedchinese>我会在那里等着你的 拔刀斋！</c.simplifiedchinese>

330
00:21:06,736 --> 00:21:07,946
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心！</c.simplifiedchinese>

331
00:21:13,708 --> 00:21:15,335
<c.simplifiedchinese>刃卫…</c.simplifiedchinese>

332
00:22:47,312 --> 00:22:50,023
<c.simplifiedchinese>下一回 《两名刽子手》</c.simplifiedchinese>

